msgstr "Get caught, and {npc} will fight you to the death. Go ahead?"

msgid "攻击就是生死相搏。确定要攻击{npc}吗？"
msgstr "Attacking means a fight to the death. Attack {npc}?"

msgid "切磋点到为止。确定要和{npc}切磋吗？"
msgstr "A spar stops short of harm. Spar with {npc}?"

msgid "确定切磋"
msgstr "Spar"

msgid "{npc}会拆三回合给你看，点到为止、不伤人。确定要讨教吗？"
msgstr "{npc} will go three rounds to show you, stopping short of harm. Ask for the lesson?"

msgid "确定讨教"
msgstr "Ask"

msgid "化尸粉会把{name}连同里面的 {count} 件物品一起化成一滩黄水，化掉的东西再也找不回来。\n确定要化掉吗？"
msgstr "The corpse powder will melt {name}, with the {count} items inside, into a puddle of yellow water. Whatever melts is gone for good.\nMelt it?"

msgid "把绳子往脖子上一套，就是寻死：你会就此死去，和战死一样付出死亡的代价。\n确定要上吊吗？"
msgstr "Put the rope round your neck and you're choosing death: you'll die here, and pay the price of death just as if you'd fallen in a fight.\nHang yourself?"

msgid "画这道符要耗去 {sen} 点神，你现在撑不住，会当场昏过去。\n确定要画吗？"
msgstr "Drawing this charm costs {sen} Spirit, more than you can take right now — you'll pass out on the spot.\nDraw it anyway?"

msgid "你伤得太重了：画符要咬破手指流血，这一点血就会要了你的命。\n确定要画吗？"
msgstr "You're too badly hurt: drawing the charm means biting your finger to bleed, and that little blood will kill you.\nDraw it anyway?"

msgid "{master}是你的师父。{zombie}会追杀{master}，它若得手，就算你弑师，等同背叛师门：\n· 被逐出{family}，门派、师父和称号都没有了。\n· 综合评价清零（现在是 {score}）。\n· 背叛师门的次数变成 {next} 次。\n确定要贴上这道符吗？"
msgstr "{master} is your shifu. {zombie} will hunt {master} down, and if it succeeds, you've killed your own master, which counts as betraying your school:\n· You'll be cast out of {family}: no school, no shifu, no title.\n· Your Standing is wiped (it's {score} now).\n· Your count of betrayals becomes {next}.\nStick the charm on anyway?"

msgid "{item}正装备在你身上。确定把它送给{npc}吗？送出去的东西一般就要不回来了。"
msgstr "You're wearing {item}. Give it to {npc}? Things you give away usually don't come back."

msgid "确定把{money}送给{npc}吗？送出去的钱一般就要不回来了。"
msgstr "Give {money} to {npc}? Money you give away usually doesn't come back."

msgid "{npc}收下{item}，就会当场收你为徒。\n{warning}"
msgstr "Once {npc} accepts {item}, you'll be taken on as a disciple on the spot.\n{warning}"

msgid "{item}不值钱，丢在地上就没人会注意它——丢下就再也找不回来了。\n确定要丢下吗？"
msgstr "{item} is worthless; drop it and no one will notice it — once it's down, it's gone for good.\nDrop it?"

