msgid "你的尸体和留在上面的东西还在：{place}"
msgstr "Your body and what's left on it are still at: {place}"

msgid "{name}倒在{place}，没能跟上你。"
msgstr "{name} fell at {place} and couldn't keep up with you."

msgid "{name}还在{place}等你。"
msgstr "{name} is still waiting for you at {place}."

msgid "你的实战经验还不够，过不去。"
msgstr "You don't have the combat experience to get through."

msgid "你来到%s。"
msgstr "You arrive at %s."

msgid "%s锁着。"
msgstr "The %s is locked."

msgid "潜能已满（最多 {cap} 点未用），再打下去潜能不会增长。先去请教师父或自学，用掉一些潜能吧。"
msgstr "Potential is full (at most {cap} unspent); more fighting won't add any. Go learn from your shifu or study on your own to spend some."

msgid "{name}找了过来，又跟在你身边。"
msgstr "{name} catches up and falls in beside you again."

msgid "{name}没有跟上来，还在{place}。"
msgstr "{name} didn't keep up — still at {place}."

msgid "到了，指路收起。"
msgstr "You're there. Guide off."

msgid "【晋阶】你现在是{title}。"
msgstr "[Promotion] You are now {title}."

msgid "【分宗】你现在是{title}。"
msgstr "[New Branch] You are now {title}."

msgid "临阵磨枪？来不及啦。"
msgstr "Cramming right before the fight? Too late now."

msgid "你的潜能已经发挥到极限了，没有办法再成长了。"
msgstr "You've reached the limit of your potential. There's no more room to grow."

msgid "你今天太累了，结果什麽也没有学到。"
msgstr "You're too tired today. You didn't learn a thing."

msgid "{head}。"
msgstr "{head}."

msgid "你的「%s」进步了！"
msgstr "Your \"%s\" has improved!"

msgid "没有这个技能种类，用 enable ? 可以查看有哪些种类。"
msgstr "There's no such kind of skill. Use \"enable ?\" to see which kinds there are."

msgid "「{skill}」是所有{kind}的基础，不需要 enable。"
msgstr "\"{skill}\" is the basis of every {kind}; it doesn't need enabling."

msgid "你不会这种技能。"
msgstr "You don't know that skill."

msgid "你连「{basic}」都没学会，更别提{skill}了。"
msgstr "You haven't even learned \"{basic},\" let alone {skill}."

msgid "这个技能不能当成这种用途。"
msgstr "This skill can't be used that way."

msgid "你改用另一种法术系，灵力必须重新锻炼。"
msgstr "You've switched to another school of mysticism; your Mystic Power must be built up again."

msgid "你改用另一种内功，内力必须重新锻炼。"
msgstr "You've switched to another inner art; your Inner Force must be built up again."

msgid "你改用另一种咒文系，法力必须重新修炼。"
msgstr "You've switched to another school of incantation; your Arcane Power must be built up again."

msgid "你已经在战斗中了，学一点实战经验吧。"
msgstr "You're already in a fight — pick up some real experience."

msgid "你只能练习用 enable 指定的特殊技能。"
msgstr "You can only practice special skills you've enabled."

msgid "你好像还没「学会」这项技能吧？最好先去请教别人。"
msgstr "You don't seem to have \"learned\" this skill yet. Better ask someone to teach you first."

msgid "你对这方面的技能还是一窍不通，最好从先从基本学起。"
msgstr "You don't know the first thing about this kind of skill. Better start with the basics."

msgid "你现在不能练习这项技能。"
msgstr "You can't practice this skill right now."

msgid "你试著练习%s，但是并没有任何进步。"
msgstr "You try practicing %s, but make no progress at all."

msgid "你的%s进步了！"
msgstr "Your %s has improved!"

msgid "战斗中不能练内功，会走火入魔。"
msgstr "You can't train an inner art mid-fight — you'd lose control of your qi."

msgid "你必须先用 enable 选择你要用的内功心法。"
msgstr "First choose the inner art you want to use with enable."

msgid "你最少要花 10 点「气」才能练功。"
msgstr "You need to spend at least 10 Qi to train."

msgid "你现在的气太少了，无法产生内息运行全身经脉。"
msgstr "Your Qi is too low to send your breath through your meridians."

msgid "你现在精神状况太差了，无法凝神专一！"
msgstr "Your Spirit is too low — you can't concentrate!"

msgid "你现在精力不够，无法控制内息的流动！"
msgstr "Your Essence is too low to control the flow of your breath!"

msgid "你现在无法练功。"
msgstr "You can't train right now."

msgid "你坐下来运气用功，一股内息开始在体内流动。"
msgstr "You sit down and work your qi; a current of inner breath begins to flow through you."

msgid "但是当你行功完毕，只觉得全身酸麻。"
msgstr "But when you finish, you only feel sore and numb all over."

msgid "当你的内息遍布全身经脉时却没有功力提升的迹象，似乎内力修为已经遇到了瓶颈。"
msgstr "Your breath fills every meridian, yet your power shows no sign of growing — your Inner Force seems to have hit a wall."

msgid "你的内力增强了！"
msgstr "Your Inner Force grows stronger!"

msgid "战斗中冥思——找死吗？"
msgstr "Contemplating in the middle of a fight — do you want to die?"

msgid "你最少要花 10 点「神」才能冥思。"
msgstr "You need to spend at least 10 Spirit to contemplate."

msgid "你现在精神太差了，进行冥思将会迷失，永远醒不过来！"
msgstr "Your Spirit is too low — contemplate now and you'll lose yourself and never wake up!"

msgid "你现在身体状况太差了，无法集中精神！"
msgstr "You're in too poor a shape to focus your mind!"

msgid "你现在身体状况太虚弱了，无法进入冥思的状态！"
msgstr "Your body is too weak to enter contemplation!"

msgid "你现在无法冥思。"
msgstr "You can't contemplate right now."

msgid "你盘膝而坐，静坐冥思了一会儿。"
msgstr "You sit cross-legged and contemplate in silence for a while."

msgid "但是当你睁开眼睛，只觉得脑中一片空白。"
msgstr "But when you open your eyes, your mind is a blank."

msgid "当你的法力增加的瞬间你忽然觉得脑中一片混乱，似乎魔力的提升已经到了瓶颈。"
msgstr "Just as your Arcane Power rises, your head swims — your magic seems to have hit a wall."

msgid "你的魔力提高了！"
msgstr "Your magic grows stronger!"

msgid "战斗也是一种修行，但不能和灵力的修行同时进行。"
msgstr "Fighting is a kind of cultivation too — but not one you can do while cultivating Mystic Power."

msgid "你最少要花 10 点精力才能进行修行。"
msgstr "You need to spend at least 10 Essence to cultivate."

msgid "你现在精力不足，无法修行灵力！"
msgstr "Your Essence is too low to cultivate Mystic Power!"

msgid "你现在精神状况太差了，无法控制自己的心灵！"
msgstr "Your Spirit is too low — you can't control your own mind!"

msgid "你现在无法修行。"
msgstr "You can't cultivate right now."

msgid "你闭上眼睛开始打坐。"
msgstr "You close your eyes and begin to sit in meditation."

msgid "但是你一不小心却睡著了。"
msgstr "But you carelessly nod off."

msgid "你忽然觉得一阵天旋地转，头涨得像要裂开一样，似乎灵力的修行已经遇到了瓶颈。"
msgstr "The world suddenly spins and your head feels ready to split — your Mystic Power seems to have hit a wall."

msgid "你的道行提高了！"
msgstr "Your attainment in the Way grows!"

msgid "这项技能不能通过自学取得进步！"
msgstr "This skill can't be improved by studying on your own!"

msgid "你得有「%s」的入门知识才行。"
msgstr "You need a grounding in \"%s\" first."

msgid "你现在无法自学。"
msgstr "You can't study on your own right now."

msgid "你开始钻研有关「%s」的问题。"
msgstr "You set to working through questions of \"%s.\""

msgid "也许是缺乏实战经验，结果是一无所获。"
msgstr "Maybe for lack of real experience, you come away with nothing."

msgid "你苦思冥想，似乎有些心得。"
msgstr "You think long and hard, and seem to gain some insight."

msgid "你无法在战斗中专心下来研读新知！"
msgstr "You can't settle down to study in the middle of a fight!"

msgid "你无法从这样东西学到任何东西。"
msgstr "There's nothing you can learn from this."

msgid "你是个文盲，先学学读书识字(literate)吧。"
msgstr "You can't read. Learn your letters (literate) first."

msgid "你的实战经验不足，再怎麽读也没用。"
msgstr "You don't have the combat experience — reading more won't help."

msgid "以你目前的能力，还没有办法学这个技能。"
msgstr "As you are now, you can't learn this skill yet."

msgid "你现在过於疲倦，无法专心下来研读新知。"
msgstr "You're too tired to settle down and study."

msgid "你研读了一会儿，但是发现上面所说的对你而言都太浅了，没有学到任何东西。"
msgstr "You read for a while, but it's all too elementary for you. You learn nothing."

msgid "你研读有关%s的技巧，似乎有点心得。"
msgstr "You read up on the finer points of %s and seem to gain some insight."

msgid "你现在无法研读。"
msgstr "You can't read right now."

msgid "你向{npc}请教「{skill}」{count} 次"
msgstr "You ask {npc} to teach you \"{skill}\" {count} times"

msgid "你练习{skill} {count} 次"
msgstr "You practice {skill} {count} times"

msgid "你打坐 {count} 次"
msgstr "You meditate {count} times"

msgid "你冥思 {count} 次"
msgstr "You contemplate {count} times"

msgid "你修行 {count} 次"
msgstr "You cultivate {count} times"

msgid "（其间歇了 {rests} 回，共{time}）"
msgstr "(resting {rests} times along the way, {time} in all)"

msgid "{head}：{changes}。"
msgstr "{head}: {changes}."

msgid "，"
msgstr ","

msgid "{skill} {from}→{to} 级"
msgstr "{skill} level {from}→{to}"

msgid "{skill}进度 {change}"
msgstr "{skill} progress {change}"

msgid "停下：精不够了。请教一次耗精 {cost}，精须多于此数（你还有 {have}）。精要时间才回得来，窗口开着时间不走：点「歇到回满」歇一会儿再来；学了内功的，也可以在武学页运功恢复精。"
msgstr "Stopped: not enough Essence. Each lesson costs {cost} Essence, and you need more than that (you have {have}). Essence takes time to come back, and time doesn't pass while a window is open: press \"Rest Until Full\" and come back. If you've learned an inner art, you can also exert it on the Martial Arts page to restore Essence."

msgid "停下：精不够了。请教一次耗精 {cost}，精须多于此数（你还有 {have}）。"
msgstr "Stopped: not enough Essence. Each lesson costs {cost} Essence, and you need more than that (you have {have})."

msgid "身上有限时的差事，歇着时限照走，所以没有自己歇；要歇就点「歇到回满」。"
msgstr "You're on a timed errand, and the clock keeps running while you rest, so you didn't rest on your own. To rest, press \"Rest Until Full.\""

msgid "停下：实战经验不足。「{skill}」{level} 级要再学，须实战经验 ≥ {required}（你 {have}）。"
msgstr "Stopped: not enough combat experience. To learn more of \"{skill}\" past level {level} you need Combat Experience ≥ {required} (you have {have})."

msgid "停下：「{skill}」这一级的进度已经攒满。先把{basic}提高到 {level} 级，再练才有长进。"
msgstr "Stopped: this level of \"{skill}\" is fully built up. Raise {basic} to level {level} first, then practice to improve."

msgid "停下：每次只花 {amount} 点{source}，{action}不会有任何长进；多花一些再试。"
msgstr "Stopped: spending only {amount} {source} each time, {action} won't get you anywhere. Spend more and try again."

msgid "停下：{resource}的修为已到瓶颈（上限 {maximum}），再{action}，{resource}只会回落到 {maximum}。先提高{basic}吧。"
msgstr "Stopped: your {resource} has hit its limit (max {maximum}); {action} more and your {resource} will only fall back to {maximum}. Raise {basic} first."

msgid "停下：你被打断了。"
msgstr "Stopped: you were interrupted."

msgid "你停了下来。"
msgstr "You stop."

msgid "停下：已经连续 {count} 次了，歇一歇吧。"
msgstr "Stopped: {count} times in a row — take a break."

msgid "Ok."
msgstr "Ok."

msgid "赌"
msgstr "Gamble"

msgid "山烟寺"
msgstr "Mountain Mist Temple"

msgid "桑邻药铺"
msgstr "Mulberry Herb Shop"

msgid "疗伤"
msgstr "Heal Wounds"

msgid "读书识字"
msgstr "Literacy"

msgid "身体"
msgstr "body"

msgid "前脚"
msgstr "forepaw"

msgid "尾巴"
msgstr "tail"

msgid "乞丐"
msgstr "Beggar"

msgid "疯狗"
msgstr "Mad Dog"

msgid "野狗"
msgstr "Stray Dog"

msgid "杜宽"
msgstr "Du Kuan"

msgid "收破烂的"
msgstr "Junk Collector"

msgid "王铁匠"
msgstr "Smith Wang"

msgid "魏无极"
msgstr "Wei Wuji"

msgid "李火狮"
msgstr "Li Huoshi"

msgid "农夫"
msgstr "Farmer"

msgid "樵夫"
msgstr "Woodcutter"

msgid "安惜迩"
msgstr "An Xi'er"

msgid "后脚"
msgstr "hind paw"

msgid "铁锤"
msgstr "iron hammer"

msgid "这是一位来雪亭镇的外地旅客.\n"
msgstr "A traveler from out of town, passing through Snow Pavilion."

msgid "一只浑身脏兮兮的野狗。\n"
msgstr "A filthy stray dog."

msgid "野狗用鼻子闻了闻你的脚。\n"
msgstr "The stray dog sniffs at your feet."

msgid "野狗在你的脚边挨挨擦擦的，想讨东西吃。\n"
msgstr "The stray dog rubs up against your legs, hoping for a scrap."

msgid "野狗对著你摇了摇尾巴。\n"
msgstr "The stray dog wags its tail at you."

msgid "野狗用后腿抓了抓自己的耳朵。\n"
msgstr "The stray dog scratches its ear with a hind leg."

msgid "高兴地汪汪叫了起来。"
msgstr " barks happily."

msgid "庙祝"
msgstr "Temple Keeper"

msgid "这个老人看起来七十多岁了，看著他佝偻的身影，你忽然觉得心情沈重了下来。\n"
msgstr "The old man looks past seventy. Watching his stooped figure, you suddenly feel heavy-hearted."

msgid "这位$RESPECT，捐点香火钱积点阴德吧。"
msgstr "A little incense money, $RESPECT? Earn yourself some merit."

msgid "多谢这位$RESPECT，神明一定会保佑你的。"
msgstr "Thank you, $RESPECT. The gods will surely watch over you."

msgid "醉汉"
msgstr "Drunk"

msgid "一个喝得醉醺醺的年轻人.....\n"
msgstr "A young man, drunk as a lord....."

msgid "酒..... 给我酒...."
msgstr "Wine..... gimme wine...."

msgid "去去去去去.. 我又不是收破烂的..."
msgstr "Go 'way, go 'way.. I ain't a junk man..."

msgid "真没诚意, 剩么一点... "
msgstr "Cheapskate, that's all you got..."

msgid "多谢, 不过我还有酒... "
msgstr "Thanks, but I still got wine..."

msgid "听说沈记商行有在卖蒙汗药...\n"
msgstr "Heard Shen's Trading House sells knockout drops..."

msgid "嗯.. 你是想问我玉佩的事吧? 我卖给沈老板了, 那东西不吉祥...\n"
msgstr "Mm.. you're askin' about the jade pendant, huh? Sold it to Boss Shen. Thing was bad luck..."

msgid "多谢啦....."
msgstr "Thanks a lot....."

msgid "这个人不但自己收破烂，身上也穿得破烂不堪。\n"
msgstr "Not only does this man collect junk, he's dressed in it."

msgid "收破烂的吆喝道：收～破～烂～哪～\n"
msgstr "The junk collector calls out, \"Junk! Any junk! Ju-unk!\""

msgid "收破烂的嘴里嘟哝著，不知道说些什么。\n"
msgstr "The junk collector mumbles something under his breath."

msgid "收破烂的伸手捉住了身上的虱子，一脚踩得扁扁的。 \n"
msgstr "The junk collector picks a louse off himself and squashes it flat underfoot."

msgid "$RESPECT饶命！小的这就离开！"
msgstr "Spare me, $RESPECT! I'm going, I'm going!"

msgid "多谢这位$RESPECT！"
msgstr "Thank you kindly, $RESPECT!"

msgid "拳法教练"
msgstr "Fist Instructor"

msgid "李火狮是个孔武有力的大块头，他正在训练他的弟子们习练「柳家拳\n法」。\n"
msgstr "Li Huoshi is a big, burly man. He's drilling his students in the Liu Family Fist."

msgid "这里当然是淳风武馆，不然还是哪里？\n"
msgstr "This is Pure Wind Hall, of course. Where else would it be?"

msgid "在下姓李，名字就叫火狮，人称李教头的便是我。\n"
msgstr "The name's Li — Li Huoshi. Folks call me Instructor Li."

msgid "柳家拳法"
msgstr "Liu Family Fist"

msgid "哦....说来惭愧，小弟这套拳法还没学得到家, 柳馆主就教我在这里传艺。\n"
msgstr "Oh... I'm ashamed to say I haven't got the Fist down all the way myself, but Master Liu had me teach it here anyway."

msgid "话是你说的，馆主也认了。老刘回了野羊山——这扇门，他不会再进了。"
msgstr "You said it, and the master accepted it. Old Liu went back to Goathill — he'll never come through that door again."

msgid "话是你说的，馆主也认了。武馆的规矩，谁也不能例外。……老刘走的时候，把门房的钥匙擦得干干净净。"
msgstr "You said it, and the master accepted it. The hall's rules make no exceptions. ...When Old Liu left, he wiped the gatehouse key clean and left it behind."

msgid "你说认错了人，我就当是认错了人。弟子们那边，我去压。"
msgstr "You say they had the wrong man, so they had the wrong man. I'll keep the disciples quiet."

msgid "老刘前些日子不辞而别，门房的桌子空着。偏偏那几个骗子又在镇上嚷，说他是野羊山的二寨主。"
msgstr "Old Liu left without a word a while back, and the gatehouse table's been empty since. And now those swindlers are going round town saying he's the Second Chief of Goathill."

msgid "弟子们都在猜。有人说该报官，有人说该上野羊山问个明白。"
msgstr "The disciples are all guessing. Some say report it to the magistrate; some say go up Goathill and find out."

msgid "馆主不开口。骗子是你打发的——老刘到底是什么人，你给大伙一句话：说破，还是替他瞒下来。"
msgstr "The master isn't saying anything. You're the one who ran off those swindlers — so you tell everyone what Old Liu really is: say it out loud, or cover for him."

msgid "那天你和老刘在门口动了刀，弟子们都看见了——那套刀法，不是一个门房使得出来的。"
msgstr "That day you and Old Liu drew blades at the gate, the disciples all saw it — that saber work is nothing a gatekeeper could pull off."

msgid "偏偏那几个骗子又在镇上嚷，说他是野羊山的血手刘三。"
msgstr "And now those swindlers are going round town saying he's Bloody-Hand Liu of Goathill."

msgid "馆主不开口。你和他交过手，你最清楚——他是什么人，你给大伙一句话：说破，还是替他瞒下来。"
msgstr "The master isn't saying anything. You crossed blades with him; you know best. So you tell everyone what he is: say it out loud, or cover for him."

msgid "那几个骗子在镇上嚷，说咱们门房老刘是野羊山的二寨主，叫什么血手刘三。"
msgstr "Those swindlers are going round town saying our gatekeeper, Old Liu, is the Second Chief of Goathill — Bloody-Hand Liu, they call him."

msgid "老刘在武馆五年，扫地、守门、记账，没出过一回错。可弟子们听见了，就得有个说法：武馆不留匪，这是老馆主立的规矩。"
msgstr "Old Liu's been at the hall five years — sweeping, minding the gate, keeping the books — and never put a foot wrong. But the disciples have heard it, so there has to be an answer: the hall doesn't keep bandits. That's the old master's rule."

msgid "馆主不开口。骗子是你打发的，话是你听见的——他是什么人，你给大伙一句话：说破，还是替他瞒下来。"
msgstr "The master isn't saying anything. You ran off the swindlers, you heard what they said — so you tell everyone what he is: say it out loud, or cover for him."

msgid "门房老刘？在武馆五年了，话不多，人勤快。"
msgstr "Old Liu at the gate? Five years at the hall. Doesn't talk much. Hard worker."

msgid "说破门房的来历"
msgstr "Expose the Gatekeeper's Past"

msgid "告诉李火狮：门房刘安禄就是野羊山的血手刘三。\n武馆不留匪——这句话出口，武馆从此没有他的位置，弟子们会记得是你说的。\n要说破吗？"
msgstr "Tell Li Huoshi: the gatekeeper, Liu Anlu, is Bloody-Hand Liu of Goathill.\nThe hall doesn't keep bandits — once you say it, there's no place for him at the hall again, and the disciples will remember it was you who said it.\nExpose him?"

msgid "你已经说过了。"
msgstr "You've already said it."

msgid "你前头说的是认错了人。话出了口，就别改了。"
msgstr "You said before they had the wrong man. Once a thing's said, don't take it back."

msgid "的脸沉了下来。"
msgstr "'s face darkens."

msgid "……血手刘三。五年，我天天和他一张桌子吃饭。"
msgstr "...Bloody-Hand Liu. Five years I ate at the same table with him every day."

msgid "规矩是老馆主立的，我去回馆主。你做得对——只是往后弟子们看你，眼神会不一样。"
msgstr "The rule's the old master's. I'll go tell the master. You did right — only, from now on the disciples will look at you a little differently."

msgid "说破什么？"
msgstr "Expose what?"

msgid "替门房瞒下来"
msgstr "Cover for the Gatekeeper"

msgid "告诉李火狮：那伙骗子认错了人。\n武馆里没人再提这件事，刘安禄欠你一句话；可这句话从此算在你头上，日后再有人认出他，弟子们先问的是你。\n要替他瞒吗？"
msgstr "Tell Li Huoshi: those swindlers had the wrong man.\nNo one at the hall will bring it up again, and Liu Anlu will owe you one. But from now on that's on you: if anyone ever recognizes him, the disciples will come asking you first.\nCover for him?"

msgid "认错了人。我已经同弟子们说过了。"
msgstr "The wrong man. I've already told the disciples."

msgid "话已经出了口，瞒不回去了。"
msgstr "It's been said. You can't take it back now."

msgid "盯着你看了一会儿，慢慢点了点头。"
msgstr " studies you for a while, then slowly nods."

msgid "认错了人。好，我就这么同弟子们说。"
msgstr "The wrong man. Fine — that's what I'll tell the disciples."

msgid "你担着这句话，就担到底。"
msgstr "You took this on. Carry it all the way."

msgid "瞒什么？"
msgstr "Cover for what?"

msgid "点了点头。"
msgstr " nods."

msgid "进招吧。"
msgstr "Come at me."

msgid "馆主吩咐过，不许和来这里的客人过招。"
msgstr "The master's orders: no sparring with guests."

msgid "对不起，这位$RESPECT，您不是我们武馆的弟子。"
msgstr "Sorry, $RESPECT, you're not a student of our hall."

msgid "李火狮不愿意教你拳法。"
msgstr "Li Huoshi won't teach you the Fist."

msgid "你看到一位面色黝黑的农夫。\n"
msgstr "You see a farmer with a sun-darkened face."

msgid "农夫叫道：杀人哪！杀人哪！\n"
msgstr "The farmer yells, \"Murder! Murder!\""

msgid "农夫叫道：有土匪哪！光天化日下打劫哪！\n"
msgstr "The farmer yells, \"Bandits! Robbery in broad daylight!\""

msgid "一只浑身脏兮兮的野狗，一双眼睛正恶狠狠地瞪著你。\n"
msgstr "A filthy stray dog, glaring at you with mean eyes."

msgid "教书先生"
msgstr "Schoolteacher"

msgid "魏无极是个博学多闻的教书先生，他年轻时曾经中过举人，但是\n因为生性喜爱自由而不愿做官，魏无极以教书为业，如果你付他\n一笔学费，就可以成为他的弟子学习读书识字。\n"
msgstr "Wei Wuji is a well-read schoolteacher. As a young man he passed the provincial exams, but he loves his freedom too much to take an official post, so he teaches for a living. Pay him a fee and you can become his student and learn to read and write."

msgid "学费"
msgstr "Fee"

msgid "嗯 ... 读书识字是做人的第一步。"
msgstr "Hm... reading and writing are the first step in being a person."

msgid "学好了读书识字的本领，胜过于百万的家财。"
msgstr "Learning to read and write is worth more than a fortune."

msgid "所以说学问是金钱买不到的。"
msgstr "Which is to say, learning is something money can't buy."

msgid "虽然学问是无价的，不过如果你有心的话 ..."
msgstr "Though learning is priceless, if you're truly willing..."

msgid "只要五两银子。"
msgstr "...it's only five taels of silver."

msgid "手头紧？街东头的谷场正缺短工，干一回给一两。"
msgstr "Short on money? The grain mill at the east end of the street needs day laborers — a tael a shift."

msgid "对，读书识字。"
msgstr "That's right — reading and writing."

msgid "哦 ... 你是说野羊山寨的二寨主，人称血手刘三的刘安禄吗？"
msgstr "Oh... you mean Liu Anlu, Second Chief of the Goathill Stockade — the one they call Bloody-Hand Liu?"

msgid "他又出来做恶了？"
msgstr "Is he up to his evil ways again?"

msgid "你带我去见他，让我跟他说几句话。"
msgstr "Take me to him. Let me have a few words with him."

msgid "点了点头，说道：哦，向你这么有心的学生还真是不多见，好好努力将来必定前途无量，谢了。"
msgstr " nods. \"Oh, a student as eager as you is rare indeed. Work hard and your future is boundless. Thank you.\""

msgid "点了点头，说道：很好，从今天起你随时可以来问我有关读书识字(literate)的任何问题。"
msgstr " nods. \"Very good. From today you may come and ask me anything about reading and writing (literate).\""

msgid "你的诚意不够，这钱还是拿回去吧。"
msgstr "You're not sincere enough. Take your money back."

msgid "咦？我不记得收过你这个学生啊...."
msgstr "Eh? I don't remember taking you as a student..."

msgid "你看到一个粗壮的大汉，身上穿著普通樵夫的衣服。\n"
msgstr "You see a big, sturdy man in a common woodcutter's clothes."

msgid "樵夫说道：野羊山那群臭道士真是该千刀万剐....\n"
msgstr "The woodcutter says, \"Those stinking Daoists on Goathill ought to be cut into a thousand pieces....\""

msgid "樵夫说道：不知道那些牛鼻子施了什么妖法，前天回家差点迷了路。\n"
msgstr "The woodcutter says, \"Don't know what spell those ox-noses cast — day before yesterday I nearly got lost on my way home.\""

msgid "樵夫说道：唉....日子越来越不好过罗。\n"
msgstr "The woodcutter says, \"Sigh.... Life gets harder every day.\""

msgid "雪亭驿长"
msgstr "Postmaster"

msgid "杜宽担任雪亭驿的驿长已经有十几年了，虽然期间有几次升迁的\n机会，但是他都因为舍不得离开这个小山村而放弃了，雪亭镇的\n居民对杜宽的风评相当不错，常常会来到驿站跟他聊天。\n"
msgstr "Du Kuan has been postmaster of the Snow Pavilion Post Station for over ten years. He's had a few chances at promotion, but he turned them all down rather than leave this little mountain town. The people of Snow Pavilion think well of him, and often drop by the post station for a chat."

msgid "驿站"
msgstr "Post Station"

msgid "是啊... 这里就是雪亭驿，你要寄信吗？"
msgstr "That's right... this is the Snow Pavilion Post Station. Got a letter to send?"

msgid "官府的信差都改走飞鸢栈道了，咱这儿如今只剩百姓的信。"
msgstr "The official couriers all go by the Flying Kite Plank Road now. All we get here these days is folks' letters."

msgid "送信"
msgstr "Delivering Letters"

msgid "往后有信，还找你。"
msgstr "If there's another letter, I'll come to you."

msgid "送到了？好，说好的脚钱。往后有信，还找你。"
msgstr "Delivered? Good — here's your fee, like we said. If there's another letter, I'll come to you."

msgid "信丢了？……还好驿里留着底子，我再誊一封。这回别再弄丢了，陈镖头的镖局就在绮云镇街上。"
msgstr "Lost the letter? ...Good thing the station keeps a copy; I'll write it out again. Don't lose it this time. Escort Chief Chen's agency is on the street in Cloudweave Town."

msgid "信送到了么？陈镖头的镖局就在绮云镇街上。"
msgstr "Delivered the letter yet? Escort Chief Chen's agency is on the street in Cloudweave Town."

msgid "正好有封信，要送到绮云镇振远镖局陈镖头手里。驿里就我一个走不开——你若肯跑这一趟，回来给你一两脚钱。出镇往南过卧龙岗，岗上有强人，别跟他们纠缠，走你的路就是。"
msgstr "As it happens, there's a letter for Escort Chief Chen at the Zhenyuan Escorts in Cloudweave Town. I'm the only one here and I can't get away — if you'll make the run, there's a tael in it for you when you get back. Head south out of town over Crouching Dragon Ridge. There are robbers on the ridge; don't tangle with them, just keep walking."

msgid "悬赏"
msgstr "Bounties"

msgid "门外那张榜是乔阴府发的悬赏。榜上的恶人要是教你拿住了，赏银照榜发——拿不住也别逞强。"
msgstr "That board outside is the bounty list from Tallshade Prefecture. Catch any of the outlaws on it and you get the reward as posted — and if you can't catch them, don't play the hero."

msgid "一只贼头贼脑的大老鼠。\n"
msgstr "A big, sneaky-looking rat."

msgid "钱庄老板"
msgstr "Banker"

msgid "安惜迩是个看起来相当斯文的年轻人，不过有时候会有些心不在焉的\n样子，雪亭镇的居民对安惜迩都觉得有点神秘莫测的感觉，为什么他\n年纪轻轻就身为一家大钱庄的老板，还有他一身稀奇古怪的武功，所\n幸安惜迩似乎天性恬淡，甚至有些隐者的风骨，只要旁人不去惹他，\n他也绝不会去招惹旁人。\n"
msgstr "An Xi'er looks like a rather refined young man, though now and then he seems a little absent. The people of Snow Pavilion find him something of a mystery: how did someone so young come to own a big bank, and where did he get his strange martial arts? Luckily he seems calm by nature, with something of the hermit about him. Leave him alone and he'll never bother you."

msgid "安惜迩似笑非笑地望著你，脸上的神气古理古怪，不知道在想些什么？\n"
msgstr "An Xi'er gazes at you with a half-smile and an odd look on his face. What is he thinking?"

msgid "安惜迩的身影晃了一下，似乎在你身上各处大穴摸了一下，不过也许是你的错觉。\n"
msgstr "An Xi'er's figure flickers — he seems to touch every vital point on your body at once. Or maybe you imagined it."

msgid "安惜迩神情忽然严肃了起来，不过好像是在想自己的事，与你无关。\n"
msgstr "An Xi'er suddenly turns grave, but he seems to be thinking of something of his own, nothing to do with you."

msgid "安惜迩忽然呵呵呵地笑了起来，却不知道在笑些什么....\n"
msgstr "An Xi'er suddenly chuckles to himself. Who knows what at...."

msgid "咦... 要打就真打吧，光是较量多没意思？"
msgstr "Huh... if we're going to fight, let's really fight. Where's the fun in just testing each other?"

msgid "王铁匠正用铁钳夹住一块红热的铁块放进炉中。\n"
msgstr "Smith Wang is holding a red-hot lump of iron in his tongs, pushing it into the forge."

msgid "小人姓王，单名一个恒字，可是小人西瓜大的字识不到一担，只有王字会写。\n"
msgstr "The name's Wang, sir — Wang Heng. Couldn't read a word if it was as big as a watermelon; only one I can write is my own name."

msgid "这里是小人糊口的铺子，小人一家五口都住在后边的屋子。\n"
msgstr "This is the shop that keeps me fed. My family of five lives in the rooms out back."

msgid "锄头"
msgstr "Hoe"

msgid "锄头... 抱歉，锄头已经卖光了...\n"
msgstr "A hoe... sorry, hoes are all sold out..."

msgid "铲子"
msgstr "Shovel"

msgid "对不起，小人店里的铲子都给人订走了。\n"
msgstr "Sorry, every shovel in the shop's been ordered already."

msgid "铁锤？小人做的铁锤坚固又耐用，一把只要三百文钱。\n"
msgstr "An iron hammer? Mine are solid and they last. Only three hundred wen apiece."

msgid "杨掌柜"
msgstr "Shopkeeper Yang"

msgid "杨掌柜是这附近相当有名的大善人，常常施舍草药给付不起药钱的穷人\n。此外他的医术也不错，年轻时曾经跟著山烟寺的玄智和尚学医，一般\n的伤寒小病直接问他开药吃比医生还灵。\n"
msgstr "Shopkeeper Yang is well known around here as a generous soul who often gives herbs to poor folk who can't pay. He's a decent healer too — as a young man he studied medicine under the monk Xuanzhi of Mountain Mist Temple — and for a common cold or a small ailment, asking him for a remedy works better than seeing a doctor."

msgid "治伤"
msgstr "Treat Wounds"

msgid "这位$RESPECT，您看起来气色很好啊，不像有受伤的样子。"
msgstr "You look in fine health, $RESPECT. Doesn't look like you're hurt at all."

msgid "哦....我看看....只是些皮肉小伤，您买包金创药回去敷敷就没事了。"
msgstr "Let me see... just a few scrapes. Buy a packet of wound salve, put it on, and you'll be fine."

msgid "开药"
msgstr "Make Up a Prescription"

msgid "麝香给你了。替我问玄智师父好。"
msgstr "Here's your musk. Give my regards to Master Xuanzhi."

msgid "玄智师父开的方子？我看看——附子、麝香、鬼臼。"
msgstr "A prescription from Master Xuanzhi? Let me see — aconite, musk, mayapple root."

msgid "脸色沉了下来。"
msgstr "'s face darkens."

msgid "鬼臼以毒攻毒……这是阴寒入骨的方子。乔阴那边，又不太平了？"
msgstr "Mayapple root, poison to fight poison... this is a remedy for cold that's sunk into the bone. Is there trouble in Tallshade again?"

msgid "从药柜最上头一格取下一个小罐，用桑皮纸包了一小包，递给你。"
msgstr " takes a small jar down from the top shelf of the medicine cabinet, wraps a little packet in mulberry paper, and hands it to you."

msgid "师父要的东西，不收钱。我年轻时跟着他学医三年，他教的头一句：药是凉的，人心得是热的。"
msgstr "It's for my master — no charge. I studied medicine with him for three years when I was young. The first thing he taught me: medicine is cold, so the heart has to be warm."

msgid "山烟寺？我年轻时曾经跟著山烟寺的玄智和尚学医。玄智师父的医术，天底下没几个人比得上。"
msgstr "Mountain Mist Temple? As a young man I studied medicine under the monk Xuanzhi there. There aren't many in the world who can match Master Xuanzhi's healing."

msgid "一个满脸风霜之色的老乞丐。\n"
msgstr "An old beggar with a weather-beaten face."

msgid "乞丐说道：好心的大爷哪～ 赏我要饭的几文钱吧～\n"
msgstr "The beggar says, \"Kind sir, spare a few coins for a poor beggar...\""

msgid "乞丐懒洋洋地打了个哈欠。\n"
msgstr "The beggar yawns lazily."

msgid "乞丐伸手捉住了身上的虱子，骂道：老子身上没几两肉，全叫你们给咬糜了。 \n"
msgstr "The beggar picks a louse off himself and grumbles, \"Ain't got much meat on me, and you lot've chewed it all to mush.\""

msgid "多谢这位$RESPECT，您好心一定会有好报的！"
msgstr "Thank you, $RESPECT. Kindness like yours always comes back around!"

msgid "逄义是封山派中和柳淳风同辈的弟子，但是生性好赌的他并不受师父\n及同门师兄弟的喜爱，因此辈分虽高，却未曾担任门中任何重要职务\n。逄义经常外出，美其名曰：旅行，实则避债，碍于门规又不敢做那\n打家劫舍的勾当，因此经常四处寻找赚钱发财的机会。\n"
msgstr "Pang Yi is a disciple of the Empty Mountain School of Liu Chunfeng's generation. But he loves to gamble, so neither his master nor his fellow disciples think much of him; senior as he is, he has never held any post in the school. He's often away — \"traveling,\" he calls it, though really he's dodging debts — and since the school's rules won't let him turn to robbery, he's always looking for some chance to make money."

msgid "赚钱"
msgstr "Making Money"

msgid "真的？哪里有钱赚？"
msgstr "Really? Where's there money to be made?"

msgid "发财"
msgstr "Getting Rich"

msgid "发财我倒不敢想，只要有人肯雇用(employment)我，手边有几百两银子就好了。"
msgstr "Getting rich I wouldn't dare dream of. If someone would just hire me (employment), a few hundred taels in hand would do."

msgid "是的，一天一百两银子，只要不违背侠义道，我可以做任何事。"
msgstr "That's right — a hundred taels a day, and so long as it doesn't go against the code of chivalry, I'll do anything."

msgid "柳淳风是在下同门师兄。"
msgstr "Liu Chunfeng is my senior brother in the school."

msgid "阁下如果也爱好此道，不如改天兄弟陪阁下玩几手？"
msgstr "If you're fond of a little game yourself, friend, why don't I play you a few hands some day?"

msgid "牌你带回去交给师兄。我没脸拿。"
msgstr "Take the token back to my senior brother. I don't have the face to keep it."

msgid "手里的骰子掉在了桌上。"
msgstr " drops the dice in his hand onto the table."

msgid "……是我的牌。"
msgstr "...That's my token."

msgid "上个月手气背，欠了场子里一个姓罗的十二两。他不要银子，只要这块牌，说是拿去「挂两天」。我当他要个彩头。"
msgstr "Last month my luck was bad and I owed twelve taels to a man named Luo at the gambling hall. He didn't want the silver — he wanted this token. Said he'd \"hang onto it a couple days.\" I figured he wanted a lucky charm."

msgid "他拿去雪亭收拜师钱？打的是师兄的旗号？"
msgstr "He took it to Snow Pavilion to collect entrance fees? Under my senior brother's name?"

msgid "半天没说话，把面前剩的几个筹码推开了。"
msgstr " says nothing for a long while, then pushes away the few chips left in front of him."

msgid "门规我没犯过——不偷不抢，不打家劫舍。可牌是我押出去的，这一条赖不掉。你带回去交给师兄，就说逄义认了。"
msgstr "I never broke the school's rules — never stole, never robbed, never raided a house. But I pawned that token, and there's no getting out of that. Take it back to my senior brother and tell him Pang Yi owns up."

msgid "什么腰牌？在下的腰牌好好地……"
msgstr "What waist token? Mine's right here..."

msgid "摸了摸腰间，没有说下去。"
msgstr " feels at his waist and doesn't go on."

msgid "储藏室"
msgstr "Storeroom"

msgid "地下密室"
msgstr "Secret Cellar"

msgid "山路"
msgstr "Mountain Road"

msgid "书院"
msgstr "Schoolhouse"

msgid "安记钱庄"
msgstr "An's Bank"

msgid "丰登当铺"
msgstr "Harvest Pawnshop"

msgid "山坳"
msgstr "Mountain Hollow"

msgid "青石官道"
msgstr "Bluestone Road"

msgid "黄土小径"
msgstr "Yellow Earth Path"

msgid "打铁铺子"
msgstr "Smithy"

msgid "雪亭驿"
msgstr "Snow Pavilion Post Station"

msgid "谷物加工厂"
msgstr "Grain Mill"

msgid "城隍庙"
msgstr "Town God Temple"

msgid "兵器储藏室"
msgstr "Armory"

msgid "书房"
msgstr "Study"

msgid "架子"
msgstr "rack"

msgid "车马行"
msgstr "Coach Station"

msgid "官府悬赏"
msgstr "Wanted Notices"

msgid "这里是雪亭镇的街道，往北是一个热闹的广场，南边是条小路通往\n一座林子，东边则有一条小径沿著山腰通往山上，往西是一条比较窄的\n街道，参差不齐的瓦屋之间传来几声犬吠。\n"
msgstr "This is a street in Snow Pavilion. To the north is a busy square; to the south a small path leads into a wood; to the east a trail climbs along the mountainside; and to the west is a narrower street, where a few dogs bark among the ragged tiled houses."

msgid "这是一条普通的黄土小径，弯弯曲曲往东一路盘旋上山，北边有\n一间城隍庙，往西则是雪亭镇的街道。\n"
msgstr "An ordinary yellow-earth path, winding east up the mountain. To the north is a Town God temple; to the west, the streets of Snow Pavilion."

msgid "这是一条普通的黄土小径，小径往西南通往一处山间的平地，从这\n里可以望见不少房屋错落在平地上，往北则一路上山。\n"
msgstr "An ordinary yellow-earth path. It runs southwest to a flat stretch among the hills, where you can see houses scattered about; to the north it climbs on up the mountain."

msgid "这是一条说宽不宽，说窄倒也不窄的山路，路面用几块生满青苔的\n大石铺成，西面是一段坡地，从这里可以望见西边有几间房屋错落在林\n木间，东面则是山壁，山路往西衔接一条黄土小径，往北则是通往山\n上的石阶。\n"
msgstr "A mountain road neither wide nor narrow, paved with a few big moss-covered stones. To the west is a slope, and you can see a few houses scattered among the trees; to the east is the cliff face. The road joins a yellow-earth path to the west, and to the north stone steps lead up the mountain."

msgid "这是一间十分老旧的城隍庙，在你面前的神桌上供奉著一尊红脸的城\n隍，庙虽老旧，但是神案四周已被香火薰成乌黑的颜色，显示这里必定相\n当受到信徒的敬仰。\n"
msgstr "A very old Town God temple. On the altar before you sits a red-faced Town God. Old as the temple is, the walls around the altar are blackened by incense smoke — plainly the faithful think highly of the place."

msgid "你现在正走在雪亭镇的大街，往南直走不远处是镇上的广场，在你\n的东边是一间大宅院，不过正门不在这个方向，往西是一家打铁铺子，\n叮叮当当的声音大老远可以听得到，街道往北边一直通往镇外。\n"
msgstr "You are walking along Snow Pavilion's main street. Not far south is the town square. To your east is a big compound, though its front gate isn't on this side; to the west is a smithy, and you can hear its clanging from a long way off. The street runs north out of town."

msgid "这里是雪亭镇的大街，东边有一栋陈旧的建筑，看起来像是什么店\n铺，但是并没有任何招牌，只有一扇门(door)上面写著一个大大的「当\n」字，往西是一间药铺，大街往南北两个方向延伸。\n"
msgstr "This is Snow Pavilion's main street. To the east is a run-down building that looks like some kind of shop, though it has no signboard — only a door (door) with a big \"Pawn\" written on it. To the west is a herb shop. The street runs north and south."

msgid "这里是雪亭镇的大街，一条小巷子通往东边，西边则是一间驿站，\n由于雪亭镇来往的商旅、官员并不很多，因此虽然是官府的驿站，也接\n受百姓的信件，大街往北是一处山坳，从这里远远地可以望见北方的野\n羊山，出了山坳就是一条碎石路通往山上。\n"
msgstr "This is Snow Pavilion's main street. A lane leads east, and to the west is a post station; since few merchants or officials pass through Snow Pavilion, the official post takes ordinary folks' letters too. North of the street is a mountain hollow, and from here you can see Goathill far to the north; past the hollow a gravel road leads up the mountain."

msgid "这里是一处山坳，往南就是雪亭镇，一条蜿蜒的小径往东通往另一\n个邻近的小山村，一块官府立的告示牌立在路旁，上面写著有关野羊山\n土匪出没的警告标志。\n"
msgstr "This is a mountain hollow. South is Snow Pavilion, and a winding path leads east to another little mountain village nearby. By the road stands a notice put up by the magistrate, warning of bandits on Goathill."

msgid "这是一间谷物加工厂，这里是谷子脱壳成米的地方。米厂老板是一个一\n看就知道是十分精明的干瘦的中年人，老是带着一脸奸笑。你可以看到\n许多人正在忙忙碌碌的工作着，门口挂著一块牌子(sign)，往西是通往\n雪亭镇大街的大门。\n"
msgstr "This is a grain mill, where grain is husked into rice. The mill's owner is a scrawny, middle-aged man you can tell at a glance is sharp as a tack, always wearing a sly grin. You can see lots of people busily at work. A sign (sign) hangs at the door; to the west is the gate out to Snow Pavilion's main street."

msgid "这是一间素来以公平信用著称的钱庄，钱庄的老板还是个曾经中过\n举人的读书人，你可以看到钱庄里里外外都打扫得乾乾净净，一个胖胖\n的中年人坐在柜台后面，柜台上放著一块牌子(sign)，往东是通往雪亭\n镇大街的大门。\n"
msgstr "This bank has always been known for fair and honest dealing, and its owner is a scholar who once passed the provincial exams. The place is swept clean inside and out. A plump, middle-aged man sits behind the counter, and on the counter sits a sign (sign). To the east is the door out to Snow Pavilion's main street."

msgid "这是一家中等规模的当铺，老旧的柜台上放著一张木牌(sign)，屋\n里的光线不是很亮，往东的出口被一块蓝色布帘遮著，上面有「非请莫\n入」的字样，西边有一扇木雕门(door)通往大街。\n"
msgstr "A pawnshop of middling size. On the old counter sits a wooden sign (sign). The room isn't very bright. The exit to the east is hung with a blue cloth curtain that reads \"No Entry Without Leave\"; to the west a carved wooden door (door) leads to the main street."

msgid "这里是雪亭镇的街道，你的北边有一家客栈，从这里就可以听到客\n栈里人们饮酒谈笑的声音，街道往东不远处有个转角往北，如果你往东\n直走就是上山的小径了，往西则可以走到车马来往络绎不绝的官道。\n"
msgstr "This is a street in Snow Pavilion. To your north is an inn — from here you can hear people inside drinking and laughing. Not far east the street turns north at a corner; keep going east and you'll reach the trail up the mountain; to the west is the highway, busy with carts and horses coming and going."

msgid "这是一条宽敞坚实的青石板铺成的大道，路上车马的痕迹已经在路\n面上留下一条条明显的凹痕，往东是一条较小的街道通往雪亭镇，大路\n从这里往北可达水烟阁，往西南穿过黄石隘口则通往戍守京畿重地的天\n驼关。\n"
msgstr "A broad, solid road paved with bluestone slabs, worn into clear ruts by years of carts and horses. To the east a smaller street leads to Snow Pavilion. From here the highway runs north to Waterfog Pavilion, and southwest through Yellow Rock Pass to Camelback Pass, which guards the approaches to the capital."

msgid "这是一条宽敞坚实的青石板大道，大道两旁种著整齐的花木，从这\n里往北通往水烟阁，往东则是衔接雪亭镇街道的路口。\n"
msgstr "A broad, solid bluestone highway lined with neat rows of trees and flowers. From here it runs north to Waterfog Pavilion; to the east is the turning onto Snow Pavilion's street."

msgid "这是一条宽敞坚实的青石板大道，大道两旁种著整齐的花木，从这\n里往西通往水烟阁，往南则是衔接雪亭镇街道的路口。\n"
msgstr "A broad, solid bluestone highway lined with neat rows of trees and flowers. From here it runs west to Waterfog Pavilion; to the south is the turning onto Snow Pavilion's street."

msgid "这里是一间宽敞的书院，虽然房子看起来很老旧了，但是打扫得很\n整洁。墙壁上挂著一幅山水画，意境颇为不俗。书院的大门开在北边，\n西边有一扇木门通往边厢。\n"
msgstr "This is a roomy schoolhouse. The building looks old, but it's kept neat and tidy. A landscape painting of real feeling hangs on the wall. The schoolhouse door opens to the north, and to the west a wooden door leads to a side room."

msgid "这里是一间打铁铺子，从火炉中冒出的火光将墙壁映得通红，屋子\n的角落里堆满了各式铁器的完成品或未完成品，像是锄头、铁锤、铲子\n等，叮叮当当的声音敲得满屋子响。\n"
msgstr "This is a smithy. Firelight from the forge turns the walls red, and the corners are heaped with all kinds of ironware, finished and unfinished — hoes, hammers, shovels and the like. The clanging fills the whole room."

msgid "这里是一间规模不小的药铺，奇怪的是，在这里你闻不到一丝药铺\n应有的药味，有的只是一股淡淡的檀香，令人觉得心旷神怡，药铺的柜\n台就在店铺靠北的一面，柜台后是一个巨大的药柜(cabinet)， 上面的\n小抽屉只怕有七、八百个之多，但是全部没有贴标签，药铺的出口在东\n边，柜台上贴著一张发黄的纸片(sign)。\n"
msgstr "This is a sizable herb shop. Oddly, you can't smell a trace of the medicine an herb shop ought to smell of — only a faint, pleasant whiff of sandalwood. The counter is along the north side of the shop, and behind it is a huge medicine cabinet (cabinet) with what must be seven or eight hundred little drawers, none of them labeled. The exit is to the east, and a yellowed scrap of paper (sign) is stuck on the counter."

msgid "这里是负责雪亭镇官府文书跟军令往来的雪亭驿，但是因为出了雪\n亭镇往北的野羊山近年来有盗匪盘据，官府的信差最近都改走东边的飞\n鸢栈道，所以雪亭驿来往的人就少了，驿站的官员索性就开始接一些百\n姓的信件，一方面打发时间，一方面也有点事做以免被上级裁撤。驿站\n大门口上悬著一块木牌(sign)，上面写了些字。\n"
msgstr "This is the Snow Pavilion Post Station, which handles the town's official papers and military orders. But since bandits took over Goathill, north of town, the official couriers have all gone by the Flying Kite Plank Road to the east instead, and hardly anyone comes through here. So the station's officials have taken to carrying ordinary folks' letters — partly to pass the time, partly to have something to do so their superiors don't shut them down. A wooden sign (sign) with some writing on it hangs over the gate."

msgid "这里是丰登当铺的储藏室，有时候当铺里的大朝奉会把铺里存不下\n的死当货物拿出来拍卖，不过你现在只能看见一个个锁著的箱子。往西\n边穿过一道布帘可以回到当铺店面。\n"
msgstr "This is the Harvest Pawnshop's storeroom. Now and then the head clerk auctions off unredeemed goods the shop has no room for, but right now all you can see are locked chests. To the west, through a cloth curtain, is the shop front."

msgid "这里是一间布置得相当雅致的厢房，从窗子可以看到北边的天井跟\n南边的庭园中各式各样的奇花异草，以及他们所带来的淡淡香气，厢房\n的东面墙上还挂著一幅仕女图(painting)，画中是一位宫装美妇，往西\n是通往天井的出口。\n"
msgstr "This is a tastefully furnished side room. Through the window you can see all kinds of rare flowers in the courtyard to the north and the garden to the south, and smell their faint fragrance. On the east wall hangs a painting of a lady (painting), a beauty in court dress. The way out to the courtyard is to the west."

msgid "这里是一间整理得相当乾净的书房，红木桌椅上铺著蓝绸巾，显得\n十分考究，西面的立著一个书架，上面放著一排排的古书，往南走出房\n门可以看到天井。\n"
msgstr "This is a study, kept very clean. A blue silk cloth is spread over the redwood desk and chairs — quite refined. Against the west wall stands a bookcase holding row upon row of old books. South, out the door, you can see the courtyard."

msgid "这是一间堆满各式兵器、刀械的储藏室，各式武器都依照种类、长\n短、依次放在一起，并且擦拭得一尘不染，储藏室的出口在你的南边，\n面对出口的左手边有一个架子(shelf)。\n"
msgstr "A storeroom piled with all sorts of weapons and blades, every one sorted by kind and length and wiped spotless. The exit is to your south, and to the left as you face it is a rack (shelf)."

msgid "这里是一间窄小的密室，你的面前只有一个破旧的小床(bed)跟一\n些乾草。\n"
msgstr "A cramped little secret room. All that's in front of you is a shabby little bed (bed) and some straw."

msgid "短工"
msgstr "Day Laborer"

msgid "钱庄"
msgstr "Bank"

msgid "红漆大门"
msgstr "red-lacquered door"

msgid "木雕门"
msgstr "carved wooden door"

msgid "房门"
msgstr "door"

msgid "往左推"
msgstr "Push Left"

msgid "这个架子上空荡荡的，什么都没有。\n"
msgstr "The rack is bare; there's nothing on it."

msgid "你将架子往左推...，忽然「喀」一声架子又移回原位。"
msgstr "You push the rack to the left... and with a click it slides back into place."

msgid "地板忽然发出轧轧的声音，一块地面缓缓移动著，露出一个向下的阶梯。"
msgstr "The floor suddenly grinds and creaks; a patch of floor slowly slides aside, revealing steps leading down."

msgid "地板忽然发出轧轧的声音，一块地面缓缓移动著，将向下的通道盖住了。"
msgstr "The floor suddenly grinds and creaks; a patch of floor slowly slides back over the passage down."

msgid "车马行 · 靠近坐车"
msgstr "Coach Station · come close to ride"

msgid "楼梯 · 上楼"
msgstr "Stairs · up"

msgid "楼梯 · 下楼"
msgstr "Stairs · down"

msgid "小床"
msgstr "little bed"

msgid "向上的阶梯"
msgstr "steps up"

msgid "向下的阶梯"
msgstr "steps down"

msgid "山水画"
msgstr "landscape painting"

msgid "柜台 · 靠近兑换"
msgstr "Counter · come close to exchange"

msgid "药柜"
msgstr "medicine cabinet"

msgid "柜台 · 估价 / 卖断"
msgstr "Counter · appraise / sell outright"

msgid "布帘"
msgstr "cloth curtain"

msgid "红木门"
msgstr "redwood door"

msgid "招牌"
msgstr "signboard"

msgid "柜台"
msgstr "counter"

msgid "饮风客栈 · 二楼"
msgstr "Drinkwind Inn · upstairs"

msgid "官府悬赏 · 靠近看榜"
msgstr "Wanted Notices · come close to read"

msgid "木架子"
msgstr "wooden rack"

msgid "牌坊"
msgstr "archway"

msgid "告示牌"
msgstr "notice board"

msgid "石狮"
msgstr "stone lion"

msgid "旗杆"
msgstr "flagpole"

msgid "北 · 野羊山"
msgstr "North · Goathill"

msgid "东 · 青石村"
msgstr "East · Bluestone Village"

msgid "南 · 卧龙岗"
msgstr "South · Crouching Dragon Ridge"

msgid "南 · 老松岭"
msgstr "South · Old Pine Ridge"

msgid "石阶 · 茅山"
msgstr "Stone steps · Mount Mao"

msgid "西 · 水烟阁"
msgstr "West · Waterfog Pavilion"

msgid "西南 · 黄石隘口"
msgstr "Southwest · Yellow Rock Pass"

msgid "淳风武馆收徒"
msgstr "Pure Wind Hall Takes Students"

msgid "[启事] 由此过路收取黄金一两"
msgstr "[Notice] Toll for passing: one tael of gold"

msgid "太师椅"
msgstr "armchair"

msgid "石柱"
msgstr "stone pillar"

msgid "书架"
msgstr "bookcase"

msgid "仕女图"
msgstr "painting of a lady"

msgid "火炉"
msgstr "forge"

msgid "神桌"
msgstr "altar"

msgid "磨盘 · 靠近做工"
msgstr "Millstone · come close to work"

msgid "红酒"
msgstr "red wine"

msgid "这是流通中单位最小的货币，约要一百文钱才值得一两银子。\n"
msgstr "The smallest coin in circulation. It takes about a hundred wen to make a tael of silver."

msgid "文"
msgstr "wen"

msgid "银子"
msgstr "silver"

msgid "白花花的银子，人见人爱的银子。\n"
msgstr "Bright, shining silver. Everybody loves silver."

msgid "黄金"
msgstr "gold"

msgid "黄澄澄的金子，人见人爱的金子，啊～～金子！\n"
msgstr "Gleaming yellow gold. Everybody loves gold. Ahh, gold!"

msgid "布衣"
msgstr "cloth robe"

msgid "一件普通的粗布衣服，不值什么钱。\n"
msgstr "An ordinary robe of coarse cloth. Not worth much."

msgid "包子"
msgstr "steamed bun"

msgid "一个香喷喷、热腾腾的大包子。\n"
msgstr "A big steamed bun, hot and fragrant."

msgid "烤鸡腿"
msgstr "roast chicken leg"

msgid "一枝烤得香喷喷鸡腿，你还犹豫什麽？准备胃液吧。\n"
msgstr "A chicken leg roasted till it smells heavenly. What are you waiting for? Get those stomach juices going."

msgid "啃得精光的鸡腿骨头"
msgstr "chicken bone, gnawed clean"

msgid "一根啃得精光的鸡腿骨头。\n"
msgstr "A chicken-leg bone, gnawed clean."

msgid "牛皮酒袋"
msgstr "leather wineskin"

msgid "一个牛皮缝的大酒袋，大概装得八、九升的酒。\n"
msgstr "A big wineskin of stitched oxhide. It holds maybe eight or nine sheng of wine."

msgid "旧书"
msgstr "old book"

msgid "这本旧书的纸张都已经泛黄了，上面只有一些字迹模糊的字句，似乎\n提到一些呼吸方法什么的。\n"
msgstr "The pages of this old book have long gone yellow. There are only a few blurred lines of writing, something about ways of breathing."

msgid "金疮药"
msgstr "wound salve"

msgid "一颗金疮药, 可以用来敷上(apply)治伤 。\n"
msgstr "A pill of wound salve. You can put it on (apply) to treat wounds."

msgid "长剑"
msgstr "long sword"

msgid "这是一把看起相当普通的长剑，份量大约有十来斤左右。\n"
msgstr "A fairly ordinary-looking long sword, about ten jin in weight."

msgid "玄苏剑"
msgstr "Xuansu"

msgid "这是一把通体黝黑的重剑，上面生满了尖锐的倒钩，乃是乔阴柳家\n历代相传的宝剑，据说这把剑杀人不沾血，永远保持杀气。\n"
msgstr "A heavy sword, black from end to end and covered in sharp barbs — the treasured sword handed down through the generations of the Liu family of Tallshade. They say it kills without blood touching it, and never loses its killing edge."

msgid "丝绸马褂"
msgstr "silk riding jacket"

msgid "化尸粉"
msgstr "corpse powder"

msgid "这是一包用来毁尸灭迹的化尸粉，只要用一丁点就可以\n化去(dissolve)一具尸体！\n"
msgstr "A packet of corpse powder for getting rid of bodies. Just a pinch will dissolve (dissolve) a whole corpse!"

msgid "蛇药"
msgstr "snake antidote"

msgid "这是一包用来解蛇毒的药\n可以用(apply)来解蛇毒!\n"
msgstr "A packet of medicine for snake venom. You can use it (apply) to cure snakebite!"

msgid "飞镖"
msgstr "dart"

msgid "飞镖是一种十分常见的暗器。\n"
msgstr "A dart — a very common hidden weapon."

msgid "极乐逍遥散"
msgstr "Bliss Powder"

msgid "这是一种毒性猛烈的春药，你可以把它倒(pour)在酒水之中使用。\n"
msgstr "A potent and poisonous aphrodisiac. You use it by pouring (pour) it into wine or water."

msgid "这是一把看起相当普通的匕首。\n"
msgstr "A fairly ordinary-looking dagger."

msgid "单刀"
msgstr "saber"

msgid "这是一寻常的单刀，份量大约六、七斤重。\n"
msgstr "An ordinary single-edged saber, about six or seven jin in weight."

msgid "布袋"
msgstr "cloth bag"

msgid "这是一口寻常的布袋，可以用来装一些杂物。\n"
msgstr "An ordinary cloth bag, good for carrying odds and ends."

msgid "皮鞭"
msgstr "leather whip"

msgid "牛皮盾"
msgstr "oxhide shield"

msgid "八角锤"
msgstr "octagonal hammer"

msgid "这是一把八角铜锤，沉甸甸的。\n"
msgstr "An eight-sided bronze hammer. Heavy."

msgid "细剑"
msgstr "slender sword"

msgid "这是一把又细又长的剑，轻飘飘的像是女孩子家的玩意。\n"
msgstr "A long, slender sword, so light it seems like a girl's plaything."

msgid "妖刀狗屠"
msgstr "Dogslayer, the Cursed Blade"

msgid "这是一把暗绿色的鬼头刀，拿在手中沈甸甸地。\n"
msgstr "A dark green ghost-head saber, heavy in the hand."

msgid "吹雪残云靴"
msgstr "Snowdrift Boots"

msgid "吹雪残云带"
msgstr "Snowdrift Sash"

msgid "吹雪残云衣"
msgstr "Snowdrift Robe"

msgid "吹雪残云巾"
msgstr "Snowdrift Headscarf"

msgid "邪剑穿灵"
msgstr "Spiritpiercer, the Evil Sword"

msgid "这是一把血红色的的长剑，份量大约有十来斤左右。\n"
msgstr "A blood-red long sword, about ten jin in weight."

msgid "蒙汗药"
msgstr "knockout drops"

msgid "这是寻常的绿林盗贼用来作案的蒙汗药，你可以把它倒(pour)在\n酒水之中使用。\n"
msgstr "The knockout drops common bandits use on the job. You use them by pouring (pour) them into wine or water."

msgid "金刚杖"
msgstr "vajra staff"

msgid "这是一条紫铜杖，杖的两端似乎封这密文。\n"
msgstr "A staff of red copper. Both ends seem to be sealed with secret writing."

msgid "紫金冠"
msgstr "purple-gold crown"

msgid "天兵战甲"
msgstr "Heavenly Soldier's Armor"

msgid "金锋剑"
msgstr "Goldedge Sword"

msgid "一把闪闪发著金光的长剑。\n"
msgstr "A long sword that gleams with golden light."

msgid "咒剑王禅"
msgstr "Wang Chan, the Spell Sword"

msgid "这是一把桃木雕成的古剑，闻起来有一股香味，剑身刻著许多你从未见过的咒\n文，只有剑柄部份有两个依稀可以辨认的篆字：「 王 禅 」\n"
msgstr "An ancient sword carved from peach wood. It smells faintly sweet, and its blade is cut with spells you've never seen. Only on the hilt can you make out two seal-script characters: \"Wang Chan.\""

msgid "王禅剑发出一股金色的罡气，流遍$N的全身。"
msgstr "The Wang Chan sword gives off a golden aura that flows all through $N."

msgid "天师道袍"
msgstr "Celestial Master's Robe"

msgid "三清神冠"
msgstr "Crown of the Three Pure Ones"

msgid "七星翻云靴"
msgstr "Seven-Star Cloudstride Boots"

msgid "重钢战甲"
msgstr "heavy steel armor"

msgid "五股钢叉"
msgstr "five-pronged steel fork"

msgid "桃符纸"
msgstr "peachwood charm paper"

msgid "这是道士们用来画符的符纸，具有封存法力的功用。\n"
msgstr "The charm paper Daoists use to draw talismans. It can seal away magic power."

msgid "魔鞭翩珑"
msgstr "Pianlong, the Demon Whip"

msgid "穿花蛇影鞋"
msgstr "Flower-Threading Snakeshadow Shoes"

msgid "软金束带"
msgstr "soft gold sash"

msgid "紫霜血蝉衣"
msgstr "Purple Frost Blood Cicada Robe"

msgid "菩提禅杖"
msgstr "bodhi staff"

msgid "一条又粗又长，非常沈重的黄铜禅杖，上面镶著六个铜环。\n"
msgstr "A thick, long and very heavy brass monk's staff, set with six bronze rings."

msgid "风泉之剑"
msgstr "Windspring Sword"

msgid "这是步玄派历代相传的掌门信物，湛蓝色的剑身跟鹅黄色剑柄，使\n得风泉之剑成为具有「剑之王者」的美誉，除此之外，这把剑也是\n削铁如泥的利器。\n"
msgstr "The token of the Mystic Step School's Master, handed down through the generations. With its deep blue blade and pale gold hilt, the Windspring Sword is famed as \"the King of Swords\" — and it cuts through iron like mud besides."

msgid "你看到风泉之剑掉落在地上 ..."
msgstr "You see the Windspring Sword fall to the ground..."

msgid "不 ... 它飘了起来！一个人形忽然浮现，手中正握著风泉之剑！"
msgstr "No... it's rising into the air! A human shape suddenly appears, the Windspring Sword in its hand!"

msgid "飞刀"
msgstr "throwing knife"

msgid "飞刀是一种十分轻、锐利的匕首，用来当作暗器使用。\n"
msgstr "A very light, sharp little knife used as a hidden weapon."

msgid "粗布衣"
msgstr "coarse cloth robe"

msgid "蓑衣"
msgstr "straw raincoat"

msgid "草鞋"
msgstr "straw sandals"

msgid "铁斧"
msgstr "iron axe"

msgid "这是一把沈重的铁斧，用来砍柴。\n"
msgstr "A heavy iron axe for chopping wood."

msgid "这是一把沈重的铁锤，打造的相当坚实。\n"
msgstr "A heavy iron hammer, solidly made."

msgid "功德箱"
msgstr "offering box"

msgid "这是寺庙接受善男信女捐献香油钱的功德箱，你可以把想捐的钱\n放进去。\n"
msgstr "The box where the faithful put their donations of incense money. You can put whatever you want to give in it."

msgid "竹剑"
msgstr "bamboo sword"

msgid "这是一把练习剑法用的竹剑，剑尖处用布包了起来以免误伤同伴。\n"
msgstr "A bamboo sword for sword practice, its tip wrapped in cloth so no one gets hurt by accident."

msgid "粉红绸衫"
msgstr "pink silk blouse"

msgid "这件粉红色的绸衫上面绣著几只黄鹊，闻起来还有一股淡香。\n"
msgstr "A pink silk blouse embroidered with a few orioles. It smells faintly of perfume."

msgid "绣花小鞋"
msgstr "embroidered slippers"

msgid "残破刀谱"
msgstr "tattered saber manual"

msgid "这似乎是一本什么刀谱的前几页，虽然并没有关于招式的详细解说，可是\n前面有关刀法的总纲与精义倒是不少。\n"
msgstr "These look like the first few pages of some saber manual. There's no detailed explanation of any moves, but plenty on the principles and essence of the saber."

