msgid "朱鸿雪奇怪的眼神盯着你,说:\n就凭你这种小角色也想? 还不快滚!"
msgstr "Zhu Hongxue gives you a strange look and says:\nA nobody like you? Get lost!"

msgid "朱鸿雪摆了摆手，说道：\n『{target}』那件事不必办了。"
msgstr "Zhu Hongxue waves a hand and says:\nThat business with \"{target}\" — forget it."

msgid "朱鸿雪向你一甩袍袖，说道：\n真没用！不过看在你还回来见我的份上，就在给你一次机会．"
msgstr "Zhu Hongxue flicks a sleeve at you and says:\nUseless! But since you had the nerve to come back to me, I'll give you one more chance."

msgid "朱鸿雪沉思了一会儿，说道：\n请在{time}内找回『{target}』给我。"
msgstr "Zhu Hongxue thinks for a moment and says:\nBring me back \"{target}\" within {time}."

msgid "朱鸿雪沉思了一会儿，说道：\n请在{time}内替我杀了『{target}』。"
msgstr "Zhu Hongxue thinks for a moment and says:\nKill \"{target}\" for me within {time}."

msgid "你现在没有任何任务！"
msgstr "You don't have a task right now!"

msgid "你现在的任务是{type}『{target}』。"
msgstr "Your task right now: {type} \"{target}\"."

msgid "你还有{time}去完成它。"
