msgid "势力"
msgstr "Factions"

msgid "地区"
msgstr "Local"

msgid "差事"
msgstr "Errands"

msgid "普通百姓"
msgstr "Commoner"

msgid "拳脚功夫的根底，出拳踢腿、闪身贴近都从这里练起。柳家拳、天邪神掌这类拳掌指爪的专门功夫都要激发在它上面，根底越厚，激发出来越有分量。勤练拳脚，膂力也会慢慢长起来。"
msgstr "The foundation of all fist work: punching, kicking, slipping in close all start here. Specialized hand arts — the Liu Family Fist, the Wayward Palm and other fist, palm, finger and claw styles — are all applied on top of it, and the deeper the foundation, the more weight they carry. Train your fists and feet hard and your Strength will slowly grow too."

msgid "由於你勤练武艺，你的膂力提高了。"
msgstr "Thanks to your hard training, your Strength has improved."

msgid "使剑的根底：握剑、出剑、收剑的规矩都在这里。封山剑法、六阴追魂剑这些剑法都激发在它上面；没学过专门剑法的人，手里有剑也只能凭它出招。"
msgstr "The foundation of the sword: the rules for gripping, thrusting and recovering are all here. Sword styles such as Empty Mountain Sword and Six-Chaos Sword are applied on top of it; someone who's never learned a proper sword style can only fight with this, sword in hand or not."

msgid "基本刀法"
msgstr "Basic Saber"

msgid "使刀的根底：劈、砍、撩、斩的力道与分寸都从这里练起。春风快意刀、短歌刀法这些刀法都激发在它上面。"
msgstr "The foundation of the saber: the force and timing of every chop, hack, sweep and slash are trained here. Saber styles such as Spring Blade and Shortsong Blade are applied on top of it."

msgid "用手中兵刃或一双肉掌格开来招的功夫。不少剑法、刀法、杖法也能激发为招架，用本门的招式化解对方的攻势。"
msgstr "The art of turning aside an attack with a weapon or your bare hands. Many sword, saber and staff styles can also be applied as a parry, using their own moves to break up an opponent's attack."

msgid "闪身避让的功夫，对方的招式能不能落在身上，多半看它。倒乱七星步、火蝠身法、七宝天岚舞这类身法都激发在它上面。"
msgstr "The art of slipping aside. Whether an opponent's moves land on you mostly comes down to this. Footwork such as the Seven-Star Chaos Steps, Pyrobat Steps and Stormdance are all applied on top of it."

msgid "一切内功的根基。内力的上限看它，打坐积下的内力才有地方存，运功调息、回气提神也都靠它；封山派内功、天邪神功等各家心法都要激发在它上面。内功修炼有成，根骨也会随之改善。"
msgstr "The root of every inner art. It sets your Inner Force cap, gives the force you build by meditating somewhere to go, and powers exerting, steadying your breath and restoring yourself. Every school's method — Empty Mountain Force, the Wayward Art and the rest — is applied on top of it. As your inner art matures, your Constitution improves with it."

msgid "由於你的内功修炼有成，你的体质改善了。"
msgstr "Your inner art has matured, and your Constitution has improved."

msgid "乔阴柳家的柳东芦于七十年前所创：他是封山剑派第十二代掌门，以剑术成名，却把家传拳法融进封山剑意，创出这套适合膂力不强之人习练的拳法，补上了封山剑派近战的短处，后来更凭它力压群雄，夺得第九代武林盟主之位。柳家拳分内八套、外八套，流传在外的多是外八套，不须内功根基，容易上手；内八套是柳家秘传，外形一样，内力窍门却全然不同。练时须空手。"
msgstr "Created seventy years ago by Liu Donglu of the Liu family of Tallshade. Twelfth Master of the Empty Mountain School and famous for his swordsmanship, he worked his family's fist into the spirit of the Empty Mountain sword, making a fist style suited to people of no great strength. It covered the Empty Mountain School's weakness at close quarters, and later he used it to beat every rival and become the ninth Alliance Leader of the wulin. The Liu Family Fist has eight inner forms and eight outer; what's spread outside the family is mostly the outer eight, which need no inner-art grounding and are easy to pick up. The inner eight are the Liu family's secret — the same forms on the outside, but entirely different tricks of inner force. It must be practiced bare-handed."

msgid "你的体力不够了，休息一下再练吧。"
msgstr "You're out of strength. Rest a while before you train again."

msgid "练柳家拳法必须空手。"
msgstr "The Liu Family Fist must be practiced bare-handed."

msgid "逼"
msgstr "Press"

msgid "压"
msgstr "Crush"

msgid "抢压"
msgstr "Rush In"

msgid "先打实一拳贴上去，贴着才打得出重拳，一拳比一拳沉；打空了就被拉开。"
msgstr "Land one real punch and stick close — only up close can you throw the heavy ones, each harder than the last. Miss and you're pushed back out."

msgid "$N使一招「古松挂月」，对准$n的$l「呼」地一拳"
msgstr "$N {N:use|uses} \"Moon on the Old Pine,\" whooshing a punch at $n's $l"

msgid "$N扬起拳头，一招「傲雪冬梅」便往$n的$l招呼过去"
msgstr "$N {N:raise|raises} a fist and {N:send|sends} \"Plum Defying the Snow\" at $n's $l"

msgid "$N左手虚晃，右拳「孤崖听涛」往$n的$l击出"
msgstr "$N {N:feint|feints} with the left and {N:strike|strikes} at $n's $l with the right — \"Surf Below a Lone Cliff\""

msgid "$N步履一沉，左拳拉开，右拳使出「荒山虎吟」击向$n$l"
msgstr "$N {N:sink|sinks} into {N:his} stance, draws back the left fist, and {N:drive|drives} the right at $n's $l — \"Tiger's Growl on a Barren Hill\""

msgid "封山派内功"
msgstr "Empty Mountain Force"

msgid "封山剑派的本门内功，只能向师长学，或在运功中慢慢精熟。封山剑法必须配合它才能练；运起功来，还能为自己疗伤。"
msgstr "The Empty Mountain School's own inner art. It can only be learned from one's elders, or slowly perfected by exerting it. Empty Mountain Sword can only be practiced with it, and when exerted it can heal your own wounds."

msgid "封山派内功只能用学的，或是从运用(exert)中增加熟练度。"
msgstr "Empty Mountain Force can only be learned, or improved by using it (exert)."

msgid "封山剑派是当今武林最大的一支剑派，这套剑法是当年创派的三位剑术名家在封山灵狐顶相互印证、合力创出的。招式并不难学，难在剑意：自「剑气」练起，次练「剑心」「剑芒」「剑神」，四者都练到登峰造极的人少之又少，所以同是封山剑法，造诣深浅不同的人使出来，威力差之千里。剑中有「封」「点」「逐」「缺」四字诀，须以封山派内功为根基。"
msgstr "The Empty Mountain School is the largest sword school in the wulin today. This sword style was forged by its three founding swordmasters, testing their skills against each other on Spirit Fox Peak of the Sealed Mountain. The moves aren't hard to learn; the hard part is the spirit of the sword. One starts with \"Sword Qi,\" then \"Sword Heart,\" \"Sword Edge\" and \"Sword Spirit\" — and few ever master all four, so the same Empty Mountain Sword can differ a world apart depending on who wields it. The sword holds four secrets — Seal, Point, Chase and Gap — and it rests on Empty Mountain Force."

msgid "你按著所学练了一遍封山剑法。"
msgstr "You run through Empty Mountain Sword as you were taught."

msgid "你的内力或气不够，没有办法练习封山剑法。"
msgstr "Your Inner Force or Qi isn't enough to practice Empty Mountain Sword."

msgid "你的内力不够，没有办法练封山剑法。"
msgstr "Your Inner Force isn't enough to practice Empty Mountain Sword."

msgid "封山剑法必须配合封山派内功才能练。"
msgstr "Empty Mountain Sword can only be practiced together with Empty Mountain Force."

msgid "你必须先找一把剑才能练剑法。"
msgstr "You need to find a sword before you can practice swordplay."

msgid "引"
msgstr "Lure"

msgid "逐"
msgstr "Chase"

msgid "候隙"
msgstr "Wait for an Opening"

msgid "不抢先：对方刺空或被架开，那一下就多出一剑，可以追，也可以封。"
msgstr "Don't strike first: when the opponent thrusts wide or gets parried, that moment gives you an extra thrust — to chase, or to seal."

msgid "隙"
msgstr "Opening"

msgid "$N使一招「峰回路转」，手中$w如一条银蛇般刺向$n的$l"
msgstr "$N {N:use|uses} \"Peaks Turn, Paths Wind,\" and {N:his} $w darts like a silver snake at $n's $l"

msgid "$N使出封山剑法中的「空山鸟语」，剑光霍霍斩向$n的$l"
msgstr "$N {N:use|uses} the Empty Mountain Sword's \"Birdsong in Empty Mountains,\" {N:his} blade flashing down at $n's $l"

msgid "$N一招「御风而行」，身形陡然滑出数尺，手中$w斩向$n的$l"
msgstr "$N {N:use|uses} \"Riding the Wind,\" suddenly gliding several feet and slashing {N:his} $w at $n's $l"

msgid "$N手中$w中宫直进，一式「旭日东升」对准$n的$l刺出一剑"
msgstr "$N {N:drive|drives} {N:his} $w straight down the middle — \"Sunrise in the East\" — thrusting at $n's $l"

msgid "$N纵身一跃，手中$w一招「金光泻地」对准$n的$l斜斜刺出一剑"
msgstr "$N {N:leap|leaps}, and {N:his} $w comes slanting down at $n's $l — \"Gold Light Floods the Earth\""

msgid "$N的$w凭空一指，一招「童子引路」刺向$n的$l"
msgstr "$N's $w points out of nowhere — \"A Boy Shows the Way\" — thrusting at $n's $l"

msgid "$N手中$w向外一分，使一招「柳暗花明」反手对准$n$l一剑刺去"
msgstr "$N {N:sweep|sweeps} {N:his} $w outward, then {N:turn|turns} it back — \"Willows Dark, Flowers Bright\" — thrusting at $n's $l"

msgid "$N横剑上前，身形一转手中$w使一招「空谷秋虹」画出一道光弧斩向$n的$l"
msgstr "$N {N:step|steps} in, sword level, and with a turn {N:his} $w draws an arc of light at $n's $l — \"Autumn Rainbow in an Empty Valley\""

msgid "认字读书的本事。不识字就读不了任何书谱；识字越深，研读书册时长进越快。勤学苦读，悟性也会慢慢提高，有些讲究文墨的心法也要它做底子。"
msgstr "The ability to read and write. If you can't read, you can't study any book or manual; the better you read, the faster you learn from books. Study hard and your Wits will slowly improve too, and some arts with a scholarly bent need it as their grounding."

msgid "由於你的勤学苦读，你的悟性提高了。"
msgstr "Thanks to your hard study, your Wits have improved."

msgid "基本行动"
msgstr "Basic Movement"

msgid "赶路奔走的根底。脚下快的人追得上人，也甩得开追兵；倒乱七星步、步玄七诀、火蝠身法这类身法，都能激发为行动。"
msgstr "The foundation of getting about. Quick feet can catch people and shake off pursuers; footwork such as the Seven-Star Chaos Steps, the Mystic Step Seven Secrets and Pyrobat Steps can all be applied as movement."

msgid "基本杖法"
msgstr "Basic Staff"

msgid "使杖、使棍的根底。山烟寺的流云杖法、绝尘派的金刚杖法都激发在它上面。"
msgstr "The foundation of staff and cudgel. Mountain Mist Temple's Cloudflow Staff and the Dustless School's Vajra Staff are applied on top of it."

msgid "基本暗器"
msgstr "Basic Throwing"

msgid "暗器出手的功夫，准头与劲道都看它。晚月庄、花紫会的人多精于此道。"
msgstr "The art of loosing hidden weapons; your aim and force both depend on it. People of Latemoon Manor and the Beggars' Guild are mostly skilled at it."

msgid "基本鞭法"
msgstr "Basic Whip"

msgid "使鞭的根底，软鞭出手要收得回来。晚月庄的寒雪鞭法激发在它上面。"
msgstr "The foundation of the whip — a soft whip that goes out has to come back. Latemoon Manor's Cold Snow Whip is applied on top of it."

msgid "步玄七诀"
msgstr "Mystic Step Seven Secrets"

msgid "四百年前「秃笔狂生」骆步玄的成名武功。他原是一介书生，未曾拜师学艺，十九岁起赴京应试，屡试不中，某年考完步出试场，偶一抬头望见街边书肆的一幅对子，竟悟出一套神奇的武功，从此闯荡江湖未逢敌手，五十岁回京定居，创立了步玄派。步玄七诀号称天下轻功「轻捷第一」，姿态潇洒有如书法，第一式「玄羽乱舞」能在短时间里加快身法；须配合步玄心法，又以音律之学为根底。"
msgstr "The art that made the name of Luo Buxuan, \"the Mad Scholar of the Bald Brush,\" four hundred years ago. He was a mere scholar who never studied under any master. From nineteen on he sat the capital examinations and failed every time; one year, walking out of the examination hall, he happened to glance up at a pair of scrolls in a bookshop by the street, and from them worked out a marvelous martial art. After that he roamed the jianghu and never met his match, and at fifty he settled in the capital and founded the Mystic Step School. The Seven Secrets are said to be the nimblest lightfoot under heaven, as graceful as calligraphy; the first form, \"Dark Feathers Dancing,\" quickens your movements for a short while. It must be used with the Mystic Step Method, and rests on a grounding in music."

msgid "你的气或神不够，不能练步玄七诀。"
msgstr "Your Qi or Spirit isn't enough to practice the Mystic Step Seven Secrets."

msgid "步玄七诀必须配合步玄心法使用。"
msgstr "The Mystic Step Seven Secrets must be used with the Mystic Step Method."

msgid "你的音律之学修为不够，无法领悟更高深的步玄七诀。"
msgstr "Your study of music isn't deep enough to grasp the higher Mystic Step Seven Secrets."

msgid "$n身影一转，轻易地避开了这一招。"
msgstr "$n {n:turn|turns} aside and easily {n:avoid|avoids} the move."

msgid "$n身法飘忽，左一点，右一顿，早已闪在一旁。"
msgstr "$n {n:drift|drifts} — a touch left, a pause right — and {n:are|is} already off to the side."

msgid "但是$n身影一侧，在间不容发之际从容地避开了这一招。"
msgstr "But $n {n:lean|leans} aside and, with a hair's breadth to spare, calmly {n:avoid|avoids} the move."

msgid "$n身形陡然拔高，使$N的攻势尽数落空。"
msgstr "$n suddenly {n:soar|soars} upward, and $N's attack meets nothing but air."

msgid "$n右足一点，身影向左滑开数尺，避了开去。"
msgstr "$n {n:push|pushes} off with the right foot and {n:glide|glides} several feet to the left, out of the way."

