msgid "你现在是{title}。改投{master}门下，就是背叛师门：\n· 综合评价清零（现在是 {score}）。\n· 背叛师门的次数变成 {next} 次。以后能收徒的师父教你武功，只教到他自己的等级减去 20 × 背叛次数为止。\n· 门派、师父和称号都换成{family}的；已经学会的武功保留。\n· 日后再改投别派，又算一次背叛。\n{lines}确定要改投吗？"
msgstr "You are {title}. Switching to {master}'s school means betraying your own:\n· Your Standing is wiped (it's {score} now).\n· Your count of betrayals becomes {next}. From then on, a master who takes students teaches you only up to their own level minus 20 × your betrayals.\n· Your school, shifu and title all become {family}'s; arts you've already learned stay.\n· Switching schools again later counts as another betrayal.\n{lines}Switch schools?"

msgid "拜{master}为师，便成为{family}的弟子。日后若再改投别派，就是背叛师门：\n· 综合评价清零。\n· 背叛师门的次数加一。以后能收徒的师父教你武功，只教到他自己的等级减去 20 × 背叛次数为止。\n{lines}确定要拜师吗？"
msgstr "Become {master}'s disciple and you join {family}. If you ever switch to another school later, that's betraying your school:\n· Your Standing is wiped.\n· Your count of betrayals goes up by one. From then on, a master who takes students teaches you only up to their own level minus 20 × your betrayals.\n{lines}Become a disciple?"

msgid "· 「{title}」这条线就此中止，以后再也接不上。\n"
msgstr "· The \"{title}\" line ends here and can never be picked up again.\n"

msgid "· 「{title}」这条线从此不会再出现。\n"
msgstr "· The \"{title}\" line will never come up again.\n"

msgid "你现在是{current}的嫡传弟子。改拜{master}为师，{current}就不再是你的师父：\n· 门派不变，辈分随{master}。\n{teach}确定要改拜{master}为师吗？"
msgstr "You are {current}'s direct disciple. Take {master} as your shifu instead, and {current} is no longer your shifu:\n· Your school stays the same; your generation follows {master}.\n{teach}Take {master} as your shifu?"

msgid "· 以后{current}只教你{pronoun}的等级超过你三倍的武功。\n"
msgstr "· From then on, {current} only teaches you arts in which their level is more than three times yours.\n"

msgid "· {current}只教嫡传弟子，以后不再教你。\n"
msgstr "· {current} only teaches direct disciples and will no longer teach you.\n"

msgid "· 你现在是{current}的嫡传弟子；三招都接住，便改拜{master}为师，{current}就不再是你的师父。\n{teach}"
msgstr "· You are {current}'s direct disciple; take all three moves and you'll take {master} as your shifu, and {current} will no longer be your shifu.\n{teach}"

msgid "{master}的三招是真打：\n· 每一招都实打实地落在你身上，挨中了会受伤。\n· 哪一招接不住，测试就算失败，你随后会昏倒。\n· 伤得太重会死。\n{after}\n确定接受测试吗？"
msgstr "{master}'s three moves are for real:\n· Every move lands on you for real, and if it hits, you're hurt.\n· Fail to take any one of them and you fail the test — and then pass out.\n· Get hurt badly enough and you die.\n{after}\nTake the test?"

msgid "· 三招都接住，便拜入{master}门下，成为{family}的弟子。"
msgstr "· Take all three moves and you join {master}'s school as a disciple of {family}."

msgid "· 这是你第一次拜师；日后再改投别派，就是背叛师门。"
msgstr "· This is your first shifu; switching to another school later is betraying your school."

msgid "· 你现在是{title}；三招都接住，就改投{master}门下，等于背叛师门：综合评价清零（现在是 {score}），背叛师门的次数变成 {next} 次；门派、师父和称号都换成{family}的，已经学会的武功保留。"
msgstr "· You are {title}; take all three moves and you switch to {master}'s school, which is betraying your own: your Standing is wiped (it's {score} now), your count of betrayals becomes {next}, your school, shifu and title all become {family}'s, and the arts you've learned stay."

msgid "· 三招都接住，{master}便愿意收你为徒，再向{pronoun}拜师即可。"
msgstr "· Take all three moves and {master} will be willing to take you on; then just ask to become a disciple."

msgid "{master}只收没有门派的普通百姓为徒。你现在是{title}，向{pronoun}拜师：\n· {pronoun}会当你要背叛师门，当众大声喝破。\n· 然后当场出手要杀你，这是一场生死之战。\n确定要向{pronoun}拜师吗？"
msgstr "{master} only takes commoners with no school as disciples. You are {title}; ask to become a disciple and:\n· {master} will take you for a traitor to your school and call it out for all to hear.\n· Then attack to kill you on the spot — a fight to the death.\nAsk anyway?"

